Package: linux-panic-button
Version: 1.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-flask, python3-psutil, python3-waitress
Maintainer: Linux Panic Button contributors <noreply@example.com>
Description: Local system health dashboard and read-only diagnostics
 A small Flask dashboard for local CPU, memory, disk, network, uptime, and
 systemd service health, plus a command-line diagnostic report generator.
